{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open-world co-op action RPG played from a third-person perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Skylorn lies in ruins. Failed experiments to incorporate magic into their technology have devastated the lands, leaving behind crumbling cities, mutated areas and hostile machines. You are one of the new arrivals, a voyager from a distant colony, sent to reclaim and restore these lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skylorn: Bound Together</i> is an open-world action RPG designed for seamless co-op play. Whether alone or with up to three players, you\u2019ll explore a handcrafted open-world, battle dangerous enemies, and develop your character through deep progression systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person combat that blends shooting, melee, and magic. Use rifles, blades, and devastating arcane powers to overcome your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill progression system with multiple paths. Specialize in ranged combat or close-quarters fighting, both with spellcasting \u2014 or create a hybrid build that suits your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-driven gameplay with quests, hidden dungeons, and environmental storytelling. Every direction reveals new dangers and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and upgrades \u2014 collect rare ingredients and loot from fallen enemies to enhance your weapons.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for co-op from the ground up, <i>Skylorn: Bound Together</i> is best experienced with friends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with teammates: shared inventory, revive each other in battle, and combine abilities for devastating synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole game can be seamlessly played together. In-progress join is possible, the newly joined player will receive the same level the other players currently have and the inventory is always shared.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players receive all experience points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joining a game is only possible via the Steam overlay, therefore its only possible to play with Steam friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for 2\u20133 players, though single-player is fully supported.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dense, handcrafted world awaits:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined cities, forgotten laboratories, and ancient structures buried beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face both monstrous creatures and robots who will challenge your journey at every turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860050/extras/20112779cddbd079761f1b3f9c51a165.avif?t=1761158847\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world sci-fi fantasy post-apocalyptic setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless co-op multiplayer designed for 2\u20133 players (single-player is also supported).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced third-person combat with ranged, melee, and magic abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep progression system with skills, weapons, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted world full of mysteries and hidden dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and weapon upgrade systems driven by exploration and loot.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ready to get started!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3860050/5afca